      "value": "Give every decoder block its own KV cache, bind that model-wide state to one exact decoder for a session, and prefill the prompt once. For the exact fixtures, advance all block caches coherently and verify that newest-position logits and generation decisions match complete-prefix references."
    },
    {
      "path": [
        "worked_inputs"
      ],
      "value": "Bind a two-layer, two-head decoder to its model-wide cache, prefill token IDs 0 and 1, decode token ID 2 without passing the model again, compare both newest-position logits with complete-prefix references within 2e-12, and then match seeded cached generation against the Chapter 36 uncached loop."
    },
    {
      "path": [
        "formula",
        "symbols",
        "0"
      ],
      "value": "the current retained prefix length and therefore the number of attention scores made when one cached newest query scans all retained keys"
